sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as 用户脚本
  participant LLM as LLM
  participant E as LLMEngine
  participant C as SyncMPClient
  participant K as EngineCore
  participant S as Scheduler
  participant X as Executor
  participant R as GPUModelRunner
  U->>LLM: generate(prompts, SamplingParams)
  LLM->>E: add_request() × N（InputProcessor 转为 EngineCoreRequest）
  loop _run_engine：直到全部完成
    LLM->>E: step()
    E->>C: get_output()
    C->>K: （另一进程）run_busy_loop → step_fn()（step 或 step_with_batch_queue）
    K->>S: schedule() → SchedulerOutput
    K->>X: execute_model(SchedulerOutput)
    X->>R: Worker.execute_model → GPUModelRunner.execute_model
    K->>X: sample_tokens(grammar_output)
    X->>R: GPUModelRunner.sample_tokens
    R-->>X: ModelRunnerOutput
    K->>S: update_from_output() → EngineCoreOutputs
    C-->>E: EngineCoreOutputs
    E->>E: OutputProcessor.process_outputs（detokenize、判停）
  end
  LLM-->>U: list[RequestOutput]
